0 FILE 31092 - Main.ldr
0 Central fuselage and chassis of a spaceship featuring wheels with towball-mount rims, technic angle connectors, plates, and inverted slopes, designed to connect the cockpit, tail boom, dual engines, and wing assemblies into a complete vehicle.
0 Name: 31092 - Main.ldr
0 Author: Marc Belanger [MonsieurPoulet]
